1
00:00:25,233 --> 00:00:26,151
‪Damn it.

2
00:00:26,234 --> 00:00:29,821
<i>‪After Yi Do and I were eliminated,</i>
<i>‪we walked out together.</i>

3
00:00:29,904 --> 00:00:31,489
<i>‪Then we saw these two doors</i>
<i>‪to choose from,</i>

4
00:00:31,573 --> 00:00:33,241
