00:00:34,117 --> 00:00:35,577
<i>‪Opening the blue door</i>

6
00:00:35,660 --> 00:00:37,704
<i>‪will mark the end of your journey,</i>

7
00:00:37,787 --> 00:00:39,873
<i>‪and you will return to your normal life.</i>

8
00:00:39,956 --> 00:00:44,044
<i>‪Opening the red door</i>
<i>‪will </i><i>‪take </i><i>‪you </i><i>‪to </i><i>‪the </i><i>‪exile </i><i>‪zone,</i>

9
