‪Seeing Yi Do's innocent face,

16
00:01:10,945 --> 00:01:14,574
‪I thought, "Actually, this could be fun."
‪And just like that, I changed my mind.

17
00:01:16,284 --> 00:01:17,494
‪You're going for it, right?

18
00:01:19,079 --> 00:01:21,039
‪-Like you have to ask. Why not?
‪-Let's go.

19
00:01:21,122 --> 00:01:22,749
