245
00:11:41,242 --> 00:11:42,410
‪This isn't easy.

246
00:11:43,577 --> 00:11:45,913
<i>‪It was really difficult</i>
<i>‪because we couldn't figure out everything.</i>

247
00:11:45,996 --> 00:11:46,831
<i>‪Then…</i>

248
00:11:46,914 --> 00:11:50,209
‪-Some sections have long sentences.
‪-Yeah.

249
00:11:50,918 --> 00:11:53,712
‪They don't have pictures.

250
00:11:54,713 --> 00:11:56,924
