275
00:12:51,812 --> 00:12:52,855
‪Oh my.

276
00:12:52,938 --> 00:12:56,233
‪The acute accent means it's an adjective.

277
00:12:56,317 --> 00:12:58,652
‪The grave accent means it's an adverb.

278
00:12:58,736 --> 00:12:59,904
‪Right.

279
00:12:59,987 --> 00:13:02,698
