00:14:20,234 --> 00:14:22,903
‪This probably means "to observe."
‪They're looking at the stars.

314
00:14:24,321 --> 00:14:26,407
‪-Kind of looks like an eye. "To observe."
‪-Right?

315
00:14:26,490 --> 00:14:29,827
‪Looks a bit like a protractor
‪or an eye looking sideways.

316
00:14:30,452 --> 00:14:33,205
‪"The human observes."
