317
00:14:33,289 --> 00:14:34,790
‪What did you say was next? "Star"?

318
00:14:34,874 --> 00:14:36,292
‪Maybe "constellation"?

319
00:14:36,375 --> 00:14:38,836
‪It could be "position of the stars."

320
00:14:38,919 --> 00:14:40,337
‪This could be "star."

321
00:14:40,421 --> 00:14:41,422
‪-This could be "position."
‪-"Position"?

322
00:14:41,505 --> 00:14:42,715
‪-"Position of the stars."
‪-Right.

323
00:14:42,798 --> 00:14:44,383
‪"The human looks at
‪the position of the stars."

324
00:14:46,051 --> 00:14:47,469
‪This is "shadow."

325
00:14:47,553 --> 00:14:48,387
‪Right.

326
00:14:48,470 --> 00:14:49,930
‪-Looks that way.
‪-"Shadow" seems right.

327
00:14:50,014 --> 00:14:51,390
‪So I think

328
00:14:51,473 --> 00:14:53,767
‪-this either means "create."
‪-"Create"?

329
00:14:53,851 --> 00:14:55,311
‪Or "exist."

330
00:14:55,394 --> 00:14:56,437
‪-"Exist"?
‪-Yes.

331
00:14:57,855 --> 00:15:00,608
‪"There is a shadow beneath the person"

