432
00:18:23,852 --> 00:18:25,104
‪-No odd numbers.
‪-Yeah.

433
00:18:25,187 --> 00:18:26,563
‪This is a riddle.

434
00:18:26,647 --> 00:18:29,108
‪It's definitely a number,
