00:18:49,378 --> 00:18:51,630
‪I just can't figure this one out.

441
00:18:52,214 --> 00:18:54,299
‪-But if it's negative…
‪-Birds don't have arms.

442
00:18:54,383 --> 00:18:55,425
‪They only have legs.

443
00:18:55,509 --> 00:18:57,052
‪So this is legs.
‪The shape makes sense.

