446
00:19:01,598 --> 00:19:04,268
‪Instead of saying "no arms,"

447
00:19:04,351 --> 00:19:06,812
‪they just left the number spot blank.

448
00:19:06,895 --> 00:19:07,855
‪This must be "legs," then.

449
00:19:07,938 --> 00:19:08,981
‪-"Legs," "arms."
‪-This one's "arms."

450
00:19:09,064 --> 00:19:10,357
‪-Done.
‪-Right?

451
00:19:10,440 --> 00:19:11,900
‪-Yes.
‪-Birds have two legs.

452
00:19:11,984 --> 00:19:13,735
‪Right, so we now know this is "two."

453
00:19:13,819 --> 00:19:15,571
‪Then this is "four." "Two, four."

454
00:19:15,654 --> 00:19:17,990
‪So the blank means zero?
